{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449110/extras/1.gif?t=1743007123\" /><strong>STELA BOSS</strong> is a roguelike that combines intense action and strategic exploration in a dark, mysterious world. Use unique elemental weapons to defeat enemies and clear the island infested with dangers in each cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIGHT TO DEFEAT THE BOSSES\u00a0</strong>Face hordes of enemies and imposing bosses as you explore a macabre island. Each battle is an opportunity to grow stronger and get closer to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DISCOVER OVER 200</strong>\u00a0<strong>WEAPON COMBINATIONS\u00a0</strong>With more than 200 possible combinations of weapons and abilities, each cycle brings new challenges and strategic possibilities. Defeat bosses at the end of the island and clear the entire territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449110/extras/2.gif?t=1743007123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GROW STRONGER WITH EACH CYCLE\u00a0</strong>Even in defeat, there is progress. Each time you face and defeat bosses, you become more powerful, unlocking abilities for future challenges. This is your journey to overcome the island\u2019s shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A UNIQUE PRESENTATION\u00a0</strong>Immersive and engaging, STELA BOSS features a dark setting, an electrifying soundtrack and refined gameplay, all to bring a macabre island full of secrets to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449110/extras/3.png?t=1743007123\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/ap